Release Notes for Seq66 v. 0.99.29 2026-10-09 "TBD"

This version introduces better support for RPN/NRPN, macros, and
System Exclusive. A simple calculation dialog is provided for
trouble-shooting in the event editor.

Also many fixes, tweaks, and minor updates.

- Main window.
- Session tab.
- Pattern editor.
- RPN/NRPN/Macro dialog.
- Edit / Preferences / MIDI Clock and Input.
- Event editor.
- Miscellaneous.
  - Many tiny improvements to various parts of the user-interface.
- Documentation updated.

See NEWS for more information. Kudos to The Firesign Theatre for
the name of this release.

